// The boss's roar entering phase 2: 70 ticks, the default roar_ticks
// (docs/architecture.md section 11, "Boss 的模型和动画"), in two parts the
// game stretches on their own: 0-20 up to the blast (roar_blast_tick 20),
// 20-70 after it. Rotations are YXZ degrees about each bone's position
// along the model's axes; see assets/anims/README.md.
//
// 0: standing. 14: gathering, crouched and bent forward, head down, the
// halberd pulled in and the left fist at the chest. 17, 19: bursting up.
// 20, the blast: upright and leaning back, head thrown back, both arms
// flung out wide and up, the halberd raised high on the right. 32 to 54:
// roaring, swaying a little. 62: lowering the arms. 70: standing.
